<view class="container">
  <view class="card">
    <text class="card-title">🚑 跌倒检测</text>
    <text class="card-desc">老人手机感知到疑似摔倒时立即向您告警。选一档最贴合老人生活习惯的灵敏度。</text>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <text class="card-title">灵敏度</text>
    <view class="chip-row">
      <view
        wx:for="{{levels}}"
        wx:key="label"
        class="chip {{selectedMs === item.ms ? 'chip-active' : ''}}"
        bindtap="onLevelTap"
        data-index="{{index}}"
      >{{item.label}}</view>
    </view>
    <text class="hint {{hintWarn ? 'hint-warn' : ''}}">{{hintText}}</text>
    <button class="btn-primary" bindtap="onSave" loading="{{saving}}">保存</button>
  </view>
</view>
